        "responseBody": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Minecraft registratie</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial; background:#111827; color:white; padding:40px;\">\n    <h1>Registratie geslaagd!</h1>\n    <p>Je Minecraft-account is opgeslagen.</p>\n    <p>Je kunt dit venster sluiten.</p>\n</body>\n</html>",
